@startuml serializeStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Ready

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Ready : Init()
Ready --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

Ready --> Ready : BuildReadResponse()
Ready --> Ready : BuildWriteResponse()
Ready --> Ready : BuildRoutineResponse()
Ready --> Ready : BuildNegativeResponse()

note right of Ready
  Stateless builder.
  Each Build*() call is independent.
  No persistent state between calls.
end note
@enduml